model_answer:
\[
\left(\sqrt[4]{11}\right)^{6x+2}
=\left(\sqrt[4]{11}\right)^{2(3x-3)+8}
\]

Using \(\left(\sqrt[4]{11}\right)^{3x-3}=\frac15\):

\[
\left(\sqrt[4]{11}\right)^{6x+2}
=\left(\frac15\right)^2\left(\sqrt[4]{11}\right)^8
=\frac1{25}\cdot 11^2
=\boxed{\frac{121}{25}}
\]

